OL,3,GNEWSA'Different cultures look at autism
OL,4,Ain different ways'                     
OL,6,FShe finds the sensation of flour on her
OL,7,Fhands overstimulating ` just one of    
OL,8,Fmany things she says made her feel     
OL,9,F"quirky or different or weird" growing 
OL,10,Fup in a British-Pakistani family before
OL,11,Fher diagnosis.                         
OL,13,FWhen Hina was first diagnosed with     
OL,14,Fautism, she looked for videos online to
OL,15,Fhelp explain autism to her mum in Urdu,
OL,16,Fbut struggled to find any.             
